{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》「睇餸食飯」環節，有李安生教大家製作一道中日Fusion菜式——「柱侯醬銀鱈魚配日式蒸飯」！以惹味的柱侯醬醃製鮮滑銀鱈魚，配搭吸收了壽喜燒汁精華的豐富蒸飯，做法簡單又飽肚，大家快點買材料回家試做吧！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材與調味</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><u>簡單做法步驟</u></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"788e95e2-0d79-4aaf-8663-2431e9973836.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026nHwv4spAur1790239202.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"788e95e2-0d79-4aaf-8663-2431e9973836.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"40951290-3cfa-4e4d-ae92-31bda041071b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026evziYRAa9g1790239202.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1